        <obo:IAO_0000115>A synthesis method where the substrate is exposed to one or more volatile precursors, which react or decompose on the surface to produce a deposit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CVD</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>CVD (chemical vapour deposition) synthesis</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
