        <obo:IAO_0000115>The application of a thin cover to a sample by depositing consecutive drops of a solution on its surface, and allowing the solvent to evaporate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429</oboInOwl:created_by>
